# HK3 (run 3 of 5): the AUDITS-OFF HANG SHAPES at eight seats on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-time-gate-stack: the nosamp arm PLUS the shard argmax (S1), the drafter conv and the drafter heads (D2). The stack changes the allocation
# sequence and the capture set beyond nosamp: S1 reserves its partials buffer at warm and adds the scan and fold kernels to the verify trace, D2 adds the drafter kernels. Under the hazard doc any such change needs its own
# hang-shape runs; A1 is audits-on and cannot see this hang (audits-on is the setting that historically passed the deterministic hang point). The shapes are the nosamp gate's: concurrent4_steady, concurrent8_steady, steady_resend,
# replay_concurrent4, replay_concurrent8, concurrent8_code_equal, then the split-block and drain shapes. Each run follows its own all-four reset.
# READ: five CONSECUTIVE completions (HK1 to HK5), every user at budget, c2_smoke_check clean (two quad markers, a both-quads round, the S1 and D2 engaged lines, no fallback), no [STALL] dump, no watchdog or replay-deadline exit,
# the concurrent8_code_equal hashes equal in every run and equal to A1's. No stall watch on this profile: a stall waits for the job timeout and records nothing, which is itself the finding.
# A stall or a hang here skips the stack timing pair (TK) and stops the window. Needs A1 and H1-H5 first. Duration (estimate): 90 min.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/262k8-x experiments window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/262k8-x and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-x-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/262k8-x commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-x-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-time-gate-stack
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent4_steady,concurrent8_steady,steady_resend,replay_concurrent4,replay_concurrent8,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent5_split,concurrent8_drain
